{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34151","headline":"奉和袭美公斋四咏次韵 小松 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美公斋四咏次韵 小松","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"擢秀逋客岩，遗根飞鸟迳。\n因求饰清閟，遂得辞危敻。\n贞同柏有心，立若珠无胫。\n枝形短未怪，鬣数差难定。\n况密三天风，方遵四时柄。\n那兴培塿叹，免荅邻里病。\n微霜静可分，片月疎堪映。\n奇当虎头笔，韵叶通明性。\n会拂阳乌胸，抡才膺帝命。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34151.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34151","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}